From 5daddd9f14b1db747ab4039db3241abb93c8bb9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:32:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Arpeggiator from 1.3 (kit arp, randomizer, step repeat,
 walk/pattern, chord simulator, MIDI/gate rows) plus latch and ratchet bounce

Ports the community 1.3 arpeggiator onto 1.2.1 with the 1.2.1 vertical menus. Adds arp latch and ratchet bounce (bouncing-ball spacing and velocity of ratchet notes). Reverse probability works per voice. Review fixes: late ratchet notes no longer delay the next unsynced step; no crash for an instrument without a clip.
